WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.164
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Debate!

2
00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:07.896
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:08.196 --> 00:00:10.672
Today's topic is Being a Good Friend.

4
00:00:11.683 --> 00:00:17.517
Today we practise giving our ideas. There is no wrong answer, but we must say why.

5
00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:19.854
Apologize!

6
00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:23.558
Apologize. Your turn!

7
00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:27.946
Apologize!

8
00:00:28.246 --> 00:00:29.027
Great!

9
00:00:30.017 --> 00:00:31.064
Invite!

10
00:00:31.964 --> 00:00:33.978
Invite. Your turn!

11
00:00:36.878 --> 00:00:38.088
Invite!

12
00:00:38.388 --> 00:00:39.296
Wonderful!

13
00:00:40.283 --> 00:00:41.354
Include!

14
00:00:42.254 --> 00:00:44.175
Include. Your turn!

15
00:00:47.075 --> 00:00:48.297
Include!

16
00:00:48.597 --> 00:00:49.435
Super!

17
00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.521
Encourage!

18
00:00:52.421 --> 00:00:54.911
Encourage. Your turn!

19
00:00:57.811 --> 00:00:59.090
Encourage!

20
00:00:59.390 --> 00:01:00.438
Excellent!

21
00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:04.703
Which do you like better, Apologize or Invite?

22
00:01:08.503 --> 00:01:11.142
I like Apologize because it is fun.

23
00:01:11.442 --> 00:01:12.570
Good reason!

24
00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:16.700
Use because to give a reason. For example:

25
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.220
I like Invite because it is nice.

26
00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:20.905
Your turn!

27
00:01:25.205 --> 00:01:27.576
I like Invite because it is nice.

28
00:01:28.583 --> 00:01:31.758
I think Apologize is fun. Do you agree?

29
00:01:35.558 --> 00:01:37.384
Yes, I agree!

30
00:01:37.684 --> 00:01:41.683
Be kind when you disagree. Say: I think differently.

31
00:01:42.683 --> 00:01:46.406
Listen to your friends. Take turns. Be polite.

32
00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.834
I will try, Ms. Lily!

33
00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:54.664
Great job today, everyone! See you next time. Bye-bye!

34
00:01:54.964 --> 00:01:56.024
Bye-bye!

